# Local server persistence. Defaults to .data in this checkout.
# RMC2_DATA_DIR=C:/path/to/private/rmc2-data

# Local Word-to-PDF converter, used for both the editor preview and final PDF.
# RMC2_OFFICE_EXECUTABLE=C:/Program Files/LibreOffice/program/soffice.com
# Browser path is used by browser tests only.
# RMC2_BROWSER_EXECUTABLE=C:/Program Files (x86)/Microsoft/Edge/Application/msedge.exe

# Real email (phase 1) is for the staging copy (port 5180) only. These keys must NOT be set in
# .env.local or .env; put them in .env.mail.test (see .env.mail.test.example and STAGING.md).
# The real-data dev server must never get mail credentials. Names only, no values:
#   RMC2_MAIL_MODE (local|smtp), RMC2_MAIL_ENV (local|staging|production; staging forced by script),
#   RMC2_SMTP_HOST, RMC2_SMTP_PORT, RMC2_SMTP_USER, RMC2_SMTP_APP_PASSWORD (secret),
#   RMC2_MAIL_FROM_NAME, RMC2_MAIL_FROM_ADDRESS, RMC2_MAIL_ALLOWLIST, RMC2_MAIL_REDIRECT_TO,
#   RMC2_MAIL_DRY_RUN (1 = do not send), RMC2_MAIL_LIVE_CONFIRM (leave empty)

# Live OpenAI and Supabase are not connected in this localhost milestone.
